WEBVTT

00:00.790 --> 00:02.490
Thank you for waiting.

00:02.490 --> 00:04.900
Here's your coffee jelly and cappuccino.

00:05.520 --> 00:06.980
Got another order!

00:06.980 --> 00:08.230
Shoot.

00:08.680 --> 00:10.090
Two house blends.

00:10.090 --> 00:11.980
Take your time and enjoy.

00:14.130 --> 00:17.200
We're not getting many customers today...

00:25.020 --> 00:25.960
Hey!

00:26.420 --> 00:27.960
No training!

00:28.220 --> 00:30.040
But...

00:33.560 --> 00:36.140
Customers aren't coming, huh?

00:36.140 --> 00:40.860
W-Well, it's been a whole 
week since we reopened.

00:40.860 --> 00:42.410
This is about what I expected.

00:42.960 --> 00:44.850
That's cool, but...

00:45.480 --> 00:49.020
Why have you had that tense look 
on your face all day, then?

00:50.710 --> 00:52.900
I can't believe my stocks tanked

00:53.230 --> 00:55.740
and left us so short on operating funds.

00:56.240 --> 00:57.880
I've gotta do something.

00:58.480 --> 00:59.740
I see.

01:00.190 --> 01:03.300
Well, you can start by paying us, okay?

01:21.060 --> 01:23.640
<b></b>The Café Terrace and Its Goddesses

02:35.730 --> 02:37.690
We're going to organize a detachment

